v(158, ('Which of these is NOT true of word frequency?', 'Low frequency words get faster lexical decisions than high frequency words.', 'High frequency words get faster lexical decisions.', 'Low frequency words are looked at longer.', 'A corpus can be used to estimate frequency.'),
       ('Which word gets the faster lexical decision, “home” or “hike”?', '“Home.”', '“Hike.”', 'They are the same.', 'Neither is a word.'))
